"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is the oldest of the three maids"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c32001"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a2/a22738c5cfa7d690b13934de2b8fde87d5fcc2f63f52121a90707d7b46e824fa.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c7/c7dc5572734453cdbf30ecaae5e72c4d3d94badd5fa5e50a3008522499869611.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"風華","creatorId":"vndb:s828","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s828","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s828","name":"きみづか 縁","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:39733","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c36983","characterName":"月島 千夏","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c36983"},"originalCharacterName":"月島 千夏","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is the protagonist’s childhood friend, and until a year ago, they attended the same school in a small town."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"When the protagonist moved away, their relationship turned into a long-distance one, though they hadn’t been officially dating before that."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"In fact, it was the separation that spurred them both to take the initiative, and they finally became a couple."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Perhaps because she grew up in the countryside, she is innocent and demure. She is a girl who is completely devoted to the protagonist."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She gives her all to everything, and that includes sex as well. Although she’s shy, she’s willing to try all sorts of things."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"After they were separated, they kept in touch constantly by phone and email, but during summer vacation, she comes to Tokyo all by herself because she wants to see him."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c36983"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/78/78438b08d865369671949be06ce3242b8afaf131538b8b7394a06c5d883a8784.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/99/996c27d2d949f10e462828053d7818159acb4afe04e8aef7c37597961d714b30.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"長崎 みなみ","creatorId":"vndb:s1073","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1073","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1073","name":"長崎 みなみ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:39734","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c36987","characterName":"星乃 ツカサ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c36987"},"originalCharacterName":"星乃 ツカサ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"She’s a relative of the protagonist and is like a little sister to him. She’s very attached to the protagonist and looks forward to his visits every summer vacation. She’s the cute, clingy “little sister” type"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"However, when she found out he wouldn’t be coming this year, she ended up coming to his house to see him. She prefers the protagonist, an older, kind, and mature adult ,over boys her own age."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"At school, she’s a member of the drama club. She has a promising future as a star, that you can see in her eyes. She fully immerses herself in her roles, and appears to drift into another world as she acts."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Using her woman’s intuition, she feels a 